This package implements SuperMimic: Scaling Humanoid Whole-Body Control with
One Differentiable World Model (arXiv:2610.28480).

Some implementation details are adapted from the unofficial repository
https://github.com/zita-ch/supermimic_vibed
at commit 27126bddd74381d164118ef83ee78edb58484a6b.
The upstream code is MIT licensed; its license is reproduced in LICENSE.
This package is an RX-P2/PhysX adaptation, not an official authors' release.
